{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"toolBarTop","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"title","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hasLargeTitle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" = false, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subtitle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityLabel","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents23OUDSToolBarItemsBuilderO","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarItemsBuilder","text":"OUDSToolBarItemsBuilder","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"leadingItems","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSToolBarItemV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OUDSToolBarItem"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = { [] }, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"principalItem"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarItem","text":"OUDSToolBarItem","preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSToolBarItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarItemsBuilder","text":"OUDSToolBarItemsBuilder","preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents23OUDSToolBarItemsBuilderO"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"trailingItems"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSToolBarItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarItem","preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSToolBarItemV"},{"text":"] = { [] }) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"title","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The toolbar title. Prefer a non-empty string."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"hasLargeTitle","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"title","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" must be displayed in large mode or not, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"false"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. If large mode, the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"subtitle"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is not displayed for iOS < 26."}]}]},{"name":"subtitle","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"subtitle","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" displayed below the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"title","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" if iOS 26+, "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"nil","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" by default. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never displayed if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"principalItem"},{"type":"text","text":" is not "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"nil","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional label vocalized by VoiceOver instead of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"title","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"subtitle","type":"text"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"nil"}]},{"text":" by default, used if no large title nor principal item.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"accessibilityLabel"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The items displayed on the leading side, "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"empty"}]},{"type":"text","text":" by default."}]}],"name":"leadingItems"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The item displayed in the principal (center) position, "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"nil"}]},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Only one item is supported."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If set, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"title"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is displayed only if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasLargeTitle"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"subtitle"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is never displayed."}]}],"name":"principalItem"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The items displayed on the trailing side, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"empty"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"trailingItems"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view which contains this "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"top toolbar","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" must be placed inside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationView"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise the top toolbar won’t appear.."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There must be only one "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"top toolbar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is), because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationSubtitle()"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 26+), which would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasLargeTitle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"top toolbar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" can have an optional label vocalized by Voice Over for a particular